Depending on which path and which decisions you choose, different things in the game change. For example if you kill in a specific karma event a person, you might block an event at a later point in the game where this person would be nessecary for a specific quest. And there will be many consequences like that. But that doesn't mean you have to be always good to get the best out of the game (Especially because the bad decisions are pretty funny) because a good choice can also have consequences for the player so you have to choose wisely. Also the Karma System will change how certain peole react to the player. There is a cult who serves Dark, the player, and depending on your karma the cult will evolve. You will also be able to recruit new members for the cult who will serve Dark with different things and skills. You can also give money to the cult to evolve their hideout and their possibilities. The idea is that the player can ultimately create his own "Church" and depending on the karma it will be a good or a bad "Church". And of course the karma will decide to which ending the path will lead. There will be 4 different endings btw.
